  "rep": "<!--$--><div><h1 class="title">הגדרות החשבון</h1><p class="mt-2 mb-8 max-w-2xl text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">נהל את הפרטים האישיים שלך, הרשאות גישה וניהול לידים</p><div class="accordion mb-6 max-w-2xl"><details name="x" class="group/acrdn border-b-2 last:border-b-0"><summary><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/user.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/user.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">פרטים אישיים</p><span class="text-xs font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-green-100 text-green-700">התחל כאן</span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white duration-200 group-hover/acrdn:bg-gray-950 group-open/acrdn:rotate-90 group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></summary><div class="p-6"><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">עדכן את שמך וכתובת האימייל שלך</p><form><div data-prefix="userData" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 "><div class="block"><div class="flex justify-between mb-1 ms-1 items-end "><label for="«id»" class="text-gray-600 text-sm font-medium ">שם פרטי</label></div><input id="«id»" class="h-10 w-full rounded-md border bg-white focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 disabled:opacity-50 border-gray-200 focus:outline-primary px-2.5" required="" name="firstN